('Herbs of Gold', 'Bergamot Cholesterol Care', 'supplement', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['Bergamot extract 500mg','With Globe artichoke','Bergamot extract 500mg','With Globe artichoke']::text[], ARRAY['Not recommended in pregnancy or breastfeeding due to a lack of safety data.','Contraindicated with bile duct obstruction.','Caution in individuals with severe hepatocellular disease, septic cholycystitis, intestinal spasm or ileus, or unconjugated hyperbilirubinaemia.','Contraindicated in individuals allergic to Asteraceae/Compositae (Daisy) family.','Not recommended in pregnancy or breastfeeding due to a lack of safety data.','Contraindicated with bile duct obstruction.','Caution in individuals with severe hepatocellular disease, septic cholycystitis, intestinal spasm or ileus, or unconjugated hyperbilirubinaemia.','Contraindicated in individuals allergic to Asteraceae/Compositae (Daisy) family.']::text[], ARRAY['60 tablets']::text[], NULL, true, NULL, 'HOG-0010', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['pregnancy_review_required','breastfeeding_review_required']::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[]),
